Vendored from https://github.com/arminbiere/cadical.git at tag rel-3.0.1,
commit c60730422e758ef1cebe7aeddf2dda31c996bf04.

The sources are modified during vendoring to suit R: output and fatal paths
are rerouted to R's C API, and the fork/exec compressed-file code is compiled
out. tools/vendor/patch-for-r.sh in the package's source repository performs
those rewrites and records what each one does; tools/vendor/VENDORED,
manifest.tsv and checksums.sha256 there record the provenance and let the
tree be verified against it. Those files are development tooling and are not
shipped in this tarball.
